AQ3IcHCGMoAw",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["店員態度非常糟糕，一副愛搭不理和沒耐心的口氣。\n加Line贈飲料的服務，裡面的兌換卷必須要當店員臉上才能點擊，因為兌換界面沒設計好，沒看懂先點了，卷就變成已兌換。\n店員也非常非常不能變通，說就是必須當他們的面點擊不然不讓，滿臉不耐煩。我們就對店員解釋，Line都是今天才加上，兌換卷發送的時間點也就是幾1～2分鐘前，這樣誤操作就不能領，設計很不人性化。\n就算這樣跟店員解釋了，3個店員也是一臉不耐煩和推脫，最後還說“那你就領吧，直接拿就好”，一副客人是來乞討的嘴臉，沒見過這種店員！！\n店員也一臉無所謂，根本沒有任何服務精神！\n原本吃完飯的好心情都被毀了。\n大家如果要兌換飲料的切記小心，而且不要期待這家麵匡匡-莊敬店有任何良好服務，店員只想把你打發走！\n第一次在Google地圖給差評，真的讓人心情很差！",null,[0,81]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16887994823830116009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrWVdOSGJGZFdNbXhOVlVWUmVsUkZTbE5hYTFZd1ZUSndibEV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16887994823830116009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrWVdOSGJGZFdNbXhOVlVWUmVsUkZTbE5hYTFZd1ZUSndibEV4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16887994823830116009/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrWVdOSGJGZFdNbXhOVlVWUmVsUkZTbE5hYTFZd1ZUSndibEV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16887994823830116009/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrWVdOSGJGZFdNbXhOVlVWUmVsUkZTbE5hYTFZd1ZUSndibEV4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16887994823830116009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrWVdOSGJGZFdNbXhOVlVWUmVsUkZTbE5hYTFZd1ZUSndibEV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16887994823830116009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrWVdOSGJGZFdNbXhOVlVWUmVsUkZTbE5hYTFZd1ZUSndibEV4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,560,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkYWNHbFdWMmxNVUVRelRFSlNaa1YwVTJwblExRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd2d6f85cc1800a4e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkdacGlWV2lMUEQzTEJSZkV0U2pnQ1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljR